    "Object obj-NN is plugins[NN] of parameters. Its layer and its class are named pio- and the plug-in name, so an export entity on that layer or class comes from that object.",
    "Each object sits at the centre of a grid cell of cell_mm. A path object follows the path kind of its probe row: an open path of three points or a closed square, inside its cell.",
    "Plug-ins: Wide Flange - 3D, Pillow Block, Pillow Block - 3D, Ellipsoid Object, Roller Chain - Linear, Center Line Marker, Batt Insulation, HVAC Vertical Duct, ID Leader, Switch, Revision Bubble, Receptacle, Comm Device, HVAC Damper, Datum Target Symbol, Revision Marker, Symmetry Label Object, Storypole, HVAC Outlet, HVAC Vertical Elbow, Piping Connection, Utility Cabinet, Wall Cabinet, HVAC Diffuser, Table, Workstation Pedestal, Detail Cut Wood, Geom Dim and Tol Note, HVAC Transition, Detail Bubble.",
